---
import { CONTATO_LZBA } from "../data/empreendimentos";
---

<footer class="bg-lzba-dark border-t border-lzba-border/20 text-lzba-muted">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      <!-- Coluna 1: Logo & Divisor -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block" aria-label="LZBA Início">
          <img
            src="/images/logo.png"
            alt="LZBA Construtora e Incorporadora"
            class="h-10 sm:h-12 w-auto object-contain"
            width="170"
            height="44"
          />
        </a>
        <div class="w-full max-w-xs h-px bg-lzba-border/30"></div>
        <p class="text-xs text-lzba-muted leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Solidez técnica, tradição e consistência executiva para valorizar o
          patrimônio da sua família.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 2: Menu -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h3
          class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-heading"
        >
          Menu
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-xs font-medium">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              INÍCIO
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/sobre"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              SOBRE
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/empreendimentos"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              NOSSOS PROJETOS
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/#projetos?status=destaques"
              data-filter-trigger="destaques"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              OPORTUNIDADES
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/blog"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              BLOG
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/trabalhe-conosco"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              TRABALHE CONOSCO
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="/contato"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
              CONTATOS
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 3: Contatos -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h3
          class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-heading"
        >
          Contatos
        </h3>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <a
              href={`tel:${CONTATO_LZBA.telefone.replace(/\D/g, "")}`}
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors font-medium text-xs"
            >
              11 2691 9059
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href={`mailto:${CONTATO_LZBA.email}`}
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors font-medium break-all text-xs"
            >
              {CONTATO_LZBA.email}
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <a
              href={CONTATO_LZBA.enderecoWeb}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors font-medium break-all text-xs"
            >
              {CONTATO_LZBA.endereco}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Barra Inferior de Direitos e Política -->
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-t border-lzba-border/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[10px] tracking-wider text-lzba-muted"
  >
    <p class="text-center sm:text-left">
      © LZBA Construtora • Todos os direitos reservados. Desenvolvido com ♥ por <a
        href="https://www.3djobs.com.br"
        target="_blank"
        class="text-neutral-300
        hover:text-lzba-gold">3dJobs</a
      >
    </p>
    <div>
      <a
        href="/politica-de-privacidade"
        class="hover:text-lzba-gold transition-colors"
      >
        Política de Privacidade
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
